    "As-is journey map for booking drop-in hockey across three rinks, in seven stages from trigger to book. The mood line drops through investigate, navigate and authenticate, and pain points cluster at the login and booking steps.",
    "<strong>As-is journey:</strong> 13+ taps and three different websites, with the lowest point at the login wall.",
    "", true %}

  <h3>The journey I designed for</h3>
  <p>Open the app and see every nearby session today in one list, with live spot counts. Book in a few taps, no membership needed.</p>
  {% figure "img/rinkside/journey-to-be.png",
    "To-be journey map for the same task in Rinkside: taps drop from 13 or more to 5, domains from 3 to 1, and the mood line rises steadily from trigger to repeat.",
